+	depends on INPUT
+	help
+	  Say Y here to support the BBK hall sensor framework used by the EEBBK S6
+	  (P20H130) to position its elevator camera.  It polls the up and the down
+	  hall sensor, keeps their recent samples, detects a mechanism that is
+	  pushed by hand, and carries the calibration data that the Android daemon
+	  writes through /dev/bbk_hall_core.
